                                        "sense_id": "d88f6090-6bcc-354b-bedc-6257aff95a3d",
                                        "entry_id": "95b58329-ecde-3b52-9af9-2b267d0f6ff8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "As hard as stone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79864519-d196-34b0-9c25-3de5f2d3fc80",
                                        "entry_id": "95b58329-ecde-3b52-9af9-2b267d0f6ff8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Containing or made up of stones."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30b1c2a4-816b-4e61-8fd3-48d57c9db826",
                                                "sense_id": "79864519-d196-34b0-9c25-3de5f2d3fc80",
                                                "text": "a stony path"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afb75347-6ddf-4b89-8b51-d48a39afaf3d",
                                                "sense_id": "79864519-d196-34b0-9c25-3de5f2d3fc80",
                                                "text": "The track was stony with a grassy camber up the middle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34f2bed4-cfc3-33e6-9b04-f915e8c890e8",
                                        "entry_id": "95b58329-ecde-3b52-9af9-2b267d0f6ff8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lacking warmth and emotion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1206ff9a-6e68-4ac0-9b10-10b72a7e103d",
                                                "sense_id": "34f2bed4-cfc3-33e6-9b04-f915e8c890e8",
                                                "text": "When Victor Laszlo leads the demoralized French in the “Marseilles^([sic – meaning Marseillaise]),” and even Yvonne, the chippy who is sleeping with a Nazi officer, joins in, the stoniest intellectual collapses in tears."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "860286ac-65f0-3c8b-bc9b-98452b100da6",
                                        "entry_id": "95b58329-ecde-3b52-9af9-2b267d0f6ff8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Showing no warmth of emotion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0678571d-6968-4a6a-bab5-f86e712fe303",
                                                "sense_id": "860286ac-65f0-3c8b-bc9b-98452b100da6",
                                                "text": "She gave him a stony reception with a stony silence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84b9d670-8a0b-496f-a5a4-73ac24ecfd1b",
                                                "sense_id": "860286ac-65f0-3c8b-bc9b-98452b100da6",
                                                "text": "o’er the heaps of dead, / Whose stony eyes glared in the morning light, / I trod; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f326b054-ebff-4ccd-8c28-efabc69f099e",
                                                "sense_id": "860286ac-65f0-3c8b-bc9b-98452b100da6",
                                                "text": "The Oscar-thrilled audience reacted to Mailer's attempt at humor in stony silence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3336f286-3162-496c-a636-7eb8e34146df",
                                                "sense_id": "860286ac-65f0-3c8b-bc9b-98452b100da6",
                                                "text": "Perplexed, Wheeler continues to play for a moment or two, keeping to his own internal time. But after another moment it becomes clear that something is wrong, something which everybody can see but him. He steals a glance up from his instrument, and finds that Luján is staring at him. In fact, every musician in the orchestra is staring at him, all of them wearing the same expression of stony, barely-contained ang—\nThey've been replaced."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58d2c0df-ef4f-3846-84eb-6f29363a59ec",
                                        "entry_id": "95b58329-ecde-3b52-9af9-2b267d0f6ff8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of stony broke: without any money."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "UK",
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "ellipsis",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54b0d5b2-3961-41c1-a45b-c0278c9ab255",
                                                "sense_id": "58d2c0df-ef4f-3846-84eb-6f29363a59ec",
                                                "text": "Seriously, Dedalus. I’m stony. Hurry out to your school kip and bring us back some money."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
